    "title": "Syracuse men's basketball adds non-conference game against Monmouth - NewsBreak",
    "text": "SYRACUSE, N.Y. (WSYR-TV) – The Syracuse men’s basketball team will square off against Monmouth on November 18th at the JMA Wireless Dome. SU is 3-0 all-time against against the Hawks. Syracuse and Monmouth last played in 2022, with SU coming away with an 86-71 win at the JMA Wireless Dome. Monmouth is coached by former Binghamton star King Rice. Rice’s Hawks are coming off of a 13-20 season last year. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to RochesterFirst.",
